From 8bbc0908cf2dcc12cc89e96b8675a189cc0d5555 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AxelGalvez11 <axelgalvez1121@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 18:08:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 69/70] fix(nemesis): graph connectivity-heatmap colors +
 fit-once framing; rebrand remaining UI strings to Nemesis

Graph (apps/desktop/src/app/graph/index.tsx):
- Node color is now a connectivity heatmap: unconnected/ghost nodes render light
  gray, connected nodes ramp rose->bright red by degree (was palette colors that
  made hubs near-black; ghost nodes were 38%-alpha color that parsed to near-black).
- Camera frames ONCE at first settle (zoomToFit 45px pad) instead of re-fitting on
  every engine stop, which made the low-gravity layout 'keep zooming out'.

Rebrand: config-settings applies rebrand(/\bHermes\b/->Nemesis) to schema-driven
field labels/descriptions (catches backend-provided text); cleaned source strings in
settings/constants.ts and visible strings in chat/index, preview-pane, model menus,
mcp-tab. Chat settings no longer shows 'Hermes' (verified in-app, 0 hits).
